# This app now uses per-user API keys stored in Firestore
# (users/{uid}/aiProviderKeys/{provider}) instead of shared server-side
# secrets, so no .env file or Secret Manager configuration is required
# for OpenAI or Anthropic/Claude keys.
#
# Each signed-in user enters their own API key in the app's AI Settings
# panel. The key is saved to their own Firestore user document and used
# only for their own requests through the aiProxy Cloud Function.
